<title>SINGAPORE: Ruggiero says WTO agrees on final declaration.</title>
<headline>Ruggiero says WTO agrees on final declaration.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>World trade ministers reached agreement on Thursday on a final declaration at their ministerial meeting in Singapore, with compromises to include the contentious issues of labour standards and agriculture, officials said.</p>
</text>
